      "created_at_utc": "2026-09-24T16:42:38.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-09-25 00:42:38",
      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "GRAIL & LADEE (Moon)\n\nMotorized Lightband (MLB) separation technology from Planetary Systems Corporation, acquired by Rocket Lab in 2021, supported @NASA's GRAIL and LADEE lunar missions.\n\nThese flight-proven, non-pyrotechnic mechanisms provide controlled, low-shock separation between spacecraft and launch-vehicle elements to safeguard delicate science instruments.",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "RocketLab",
