      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "ESCAPADE (Mars)\n\nRocket Lab designed and built twin interplanetary spacecraft - \"Blue\" and \"Gold\" - for @NASA and @UCBerkeley's @escapade_mars mission.\n\nBuilt on our Explorer spacecraft platform, these probes carry Rocket Lab flight computers, star trackers, reaction wheels, and solar arrays to travel millions of miles to Mars orbit to investigate how the solar wind strips away the Martian atmosphere.",
