      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-09-23 10:09:06",
      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "Rocket Lab began as a small launch company. Today, our rockets, spacecraft, and components power hundreds of missions for science and exploration, national security, and commercial constellations. \n\nHere's a tiny glimpse of how far we've evolved since Electron's first launch less than 10 years ago.\n\nRockets unlock space. Satellites do the work. We build and operate both.",
