      "text": "This is the new era of space: commercial companies delivering the cadence, innovation, and capability that once required a nation.\n\nPresident Trump’s bold, pro-space leadership and commitment to American commercial industry has made this possible. When policy empowers private enterprise to move fast, American space superiority is assured.\n\nCheck out the full @MTSlive interview with SPB. https://youtu.be/9lYK4laa4tk?si=X1EPhV7lZffS79ry",
